{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_tomimi_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_tomimi_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"崭新生活","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tomimi_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"c23ac542f4e3da3bdaafee45edbc3f3dcd93dba513aeed37ec4dcccb492336f7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"嘉维尔出紧急任务离岛了，这让特米米很沮丧，所幸，在朋友们的指点下，她克服这种负面情感并逐渐适应了没有嘉维尔的罗德岛生活。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗德岛本舰\n宿舍区 嘉维尔的宿舍前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好嘉维尔，该起床了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（不在......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（好奇怪啊，嘉维尔今天起那么早吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（还是去食堂看看吧，说不定已经在吃早饭了呢。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（这里也没有嘉维尔......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（既不在睡觉，也不在食堂吃饭。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（可能今天有什么重要的事吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（她最近应该没有外勤任务，那就只有在医疗部了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"怎，怎么会这样？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是听同事们聊起才知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上附近聚居点有份紧急委托，情况还很复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"为了保证其他干员的安全，需要医疗部派遣一位作战经验和医疗经验同等丰富的干员随行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的情况整个医疗部只有嘉维尔最合适了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"任务真的很急，部署当晚全体承接委托的干员就离开罗德岛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"她应该给你留了讯息吧，留言、纸条之类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（打开通讯终端）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"没，没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（离开阿卡胡拉的时候，她，她就没来和我打招呼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔她不会......不会又要丢下我吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你想多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在就去帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎哎等等，你怎么去啊，走过去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我开车过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么倔啊，用车要申请的，再说了你都不知道目的地，又能开到哪里去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是，你不会开车呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哭，哭什么呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"唉快别哭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你担心嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也应该知道，嘉维尔有什么好担心的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"别人伤不到她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕她......擦......擦破皮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"她是医疗干员，这种程度的伤自己能治好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，万一她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，你在这里哭诉也不是个办法，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"先回去休息一下，稳定自己的情绪，做些能让自己快乐的事，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"任务虽然急，但不是很困难的，说不定过个三四天嘉维尔就凯旋归来了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不要自己吓自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思给你添麻烦了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，哈哈，回去休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到小迷妹没了嘉维尔反应那么大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是当初一扭头就走给人心里留下阴影了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"下次得提醒她，走之前要记得和亲友报个信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不然再发生一次，特米米怕不是要用泪水把医疗部给淹了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会发生这么悲伤的事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"或许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"请坐，蓝毒小姐，身体有哪里不舒服吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔出任务了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想和嘉维尔一起出任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"做些让自己快乐的事啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我该做什么呢？我能做什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我也能变得强大起来就好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是，哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"又在罗德岛里迷路了，要是被嘉维尔知道会被敲脑袋的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（前面有人，问问她吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，阿达克利斯，有什么能帮到您的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（优雅的提裙礼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（模仿了一下提裙礼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我想问一下这里是哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您是指具体位置的话，这里是前往罗德岛机库的通道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，黎博利姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好像，有些迷茫，需要我帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我迷路了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在哪条道路上迷失了方向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我好像问了个傻问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳嗯，那么，您现在想去哪里呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......买最新的时尚杂志，离开阿卡胡拉以后很久没看了，心里有些痒痒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杂志，嗯，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"买杂志的话坐旁边的电梯上两层，出门右转笔直走，看到小喷泉以后左转，就能看到书摊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"价格可能比城市里的稍高些，但供货稳定，品种多样，还能预订想要的书刊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样啊，谢谢你，我现在就去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在出发之前，能先烦请您解答一下我的小小疑惑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？嗯，直接问就行了，不用那么礼貌的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，下次会注意的~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿达克利斯，肩上的担子，还沉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"担子？你是说背包吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（掂了下背包）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"还好吧，没有那么重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"里面都是精挑细选的宝贝，得贴身带着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放宿舍不好吗，那里是你在罗德岛的家园。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"万一找不到了，我会难过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"少任何一件都不行，还是带在身边比较合适。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的回忆，你的寄托，嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有想过放在保险箱里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"锁在箱子里的话，宝物们会生气的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，好好布置一下宿舍，把它变成仅属于你的展馆，会不会更好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懂得背负回忆是好事，但学会卸下负荷并装点它，或许会更有意义呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你说的，我不太懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是一位黎博利毫无意义的自言自语罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的疑问已经得到了答案，谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我帮忙引路吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不用麻烦的，我想我能够认得路，谢谢你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先离开了，阿达克利斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我们很快就会再相见的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（萨尔贡方言）愿你的远景如广林般浩瀚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（优雅的提裙礼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（她好像走得很急。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（通道那一头的黎博利，是她的妹妹吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（她们好像很亲密的样子。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（真好啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（小喷泉到了，左转......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这里了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"呜啊，罗德岛上也会有这样的摊子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"您是第一次光临小店吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"店里空间不够大，有时候货太多放不下了就会在店外摆个小地摊，当然，这都是提前申请报备的，可不是什么违规操作哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"您要买什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我想买最新的时尚杂志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"时尚杂志有很多种，你看，有介绍挂坠首饰的，有发布名人新闻的，有主打潮流服装的，还有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"请给我关于服装的，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......最新一期卖完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（今天运气好像不太行的样子......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你运气不错，买掉最后一本的干员还在，如果你特别想看的话，可以问问她愿不愿意和你分享。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是哪位呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那里，粉色头发的就是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫蓝毒，每次都是第一个来买杂志的，今天好像有些事，差点就没买到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你去和她搭个话吧，我想她会愿意借给你看的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，谢谢你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我还没说完呢，她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，多一句不如少一句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"或许这样能让蓝毒多个朋友呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"您，您好......请问是蓝毒姐姐吗，我叫特米米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她就是特米米吗？真是巧合。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（伸出手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......要和我握手，吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我只是想，嗯，出于礼貌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你讨厌的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（握了握特米米的手）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是蓝毒，很高兴认识你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为一些原因，别人不太愿意和我，接触。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你伸手的时候我愣住了，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找我有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我想借杂志看一下，可以吗，马上就还给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杂志？你是说这本《自我迷宫》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我维多利亚语不太好，不是很能理解上面的字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也才刚买到，还没看呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里人太多了，我们找个地方坐下来慢慢看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，拜托你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"看完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，蓝毒姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？嗯，不客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我特米米就好，加上尊称的话总觉得好像有点奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好，特米米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上......是发生了什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗部那边的干员说你的泪水会把整个医疗部都淹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......讲出来还挺难为情的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说出来心里会好受些，试试看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，是这样的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"大概就是这么回事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要笑话我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，阿达克利斯人从不会流泪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"流泪是示弱的表现，所以绝对不可以在别人面前哭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便如此，你也愿意为嘉维尔小姐哭泣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不是件难以启齿的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像对服装类的杂志很感兴趣，你的家乡也有这样的刊物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，不过依娜姆偶尔会帮我从外面带过来一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"她是我们那边做生意的人，经常帮忙从外面带些有意思的东西回来，还教我语言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"等学会语言以后，我就买她那里的书来看，有些书里的内容特别喜欢，就看得多了点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"《都市丽人》之类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，那算是比较知名的时尚杂志了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......东西做得太过流水和规范，反而失了打出名声时的灵气，唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说他们有几个编辑和摄影师想跳出来自立门户，也不知道能不能成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"蓝毒姐姐，对时尚很了解的样子，好厉害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算不上呢，只是看得多，有一些自己的品味和坚持而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，特米米，对你来说，时尚是什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太清楚，我们那边的方言没有描述时尚的词汇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"打人倒是有好几种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得，时尚应该就是好看的衣服，简单又漂亮的首饰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"阿卡胡拉没有这样的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次翻开那本杂志的时候，我才知道，原来衣服也能是那种颜色，那样的造型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"有些衣服的样子，我可能永远都想象不到，但它会在某一天，出现在我从依娜姆那里买来的杂志上，而且我能很肯定地说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"——我喜欢那件衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是很了解嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我现在身上穿的这一套，也是从杂志上看到喜欢的衣服以后，想办法做了整套然后自己改良的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然有些破......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我好像有些印象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打开并翻阅自己的随身笔记）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛尔特......狂野......怒嚎......泳装系列......珊瑚海岸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来看看，当初是这套吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"蓝毒姐姐是怎么知道的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"积累而已，有时候遇见特别喜欢的设计会剪下来贴在这本笔记里，然后写些自己的心得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"剪，剪下来？那样杂志不会坏掉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，怎么说呢......算是我个人的习惯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剪贴画报的确是破坏了书籍的整体性，但对我来说，它是一条捷径。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"捷径？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把一本杂志中你最想要获得的知识，放到一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后通过这条捷径，来到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"到脑袋里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我手上的这本，已经是第六本笔记了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最早的几本，只有在想怀旧的时候才会翻出来看几眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面除了回忆以外，已经什么都不剩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正重要的，全在脑子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成为了审美、品味、格调。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"脑袋真的能记住那么多吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不会，它只留下你最不想忘记的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，你对美的选择和追求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，对你来说的话，嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你说得对，嘉维尔的确忘不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的回忆，总是在脑袋里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"物品有时只是开启它们的钥匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到你把回忆巩固成自动门，就再也不需要钥匙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"有，有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"钥匙......宝物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"回忆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，你有试过穿搭吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"穿搭？没，还没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们现在就去商店试衣，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"试衣？可，可以吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然种类没有移动城市里的商场那么齐全，但可以先带你体验一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不介意的话，我可以找位裁缝一起去，帮你多提供点穿搭上的建议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这，这个，真的可以办到吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以呢，如果你想的话，在罗德岛上都可以全身订制一整套衣服哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声嘀咕）只是价格不太亲民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的，我，呃，我，我准备一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"一会要试衣服，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那我，我，我先回宿舍把背包放下，这样试衣服的时候可以轻松些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能认识到这点，可是一件值得庆贺的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是刚才遇到的黎博利姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的黎博利","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前忘做自我介绍了，请您原谅我的疏忽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿丝忒希娅·乌比卡，大家一般称呼我为星极。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很高兴认识你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，星极姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（伸出手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻盈地握了下手）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，星极小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，蓝毒小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想带特米米去试一下衣服，您要是方便的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧我也想选几件新衣服，能和各位同行是我莫大的荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙小姐的话，应该还在书摊那里买刊物吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，看来我猜对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真是什么事都瞒不过她......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先去和柏喙打个招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蓝毒","speakerId":"avg_129_bluep_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）星极，星极姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）怎么啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）你之前说的，布置成展馆，大概是怎么做啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）来，看到那边的小喷泉了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）喷泉上有个浮雕，是不是很漂亮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）如果那个浮雕是你精心保存的藏品，你会不会觉得，很开心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）嗯......嗯嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）就是这么回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）把美好的回忆放在特别为其制作的台座上，总是一件能够让人欣喜的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）如果有需要，还可以在台座上加装其他装置，可以防止外力破坏，也能把物品的寿命延长许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）听起来挺不错的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）那，有，有空的话，可不可以麻烦您，帮忙，嗯，规划？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）装饰挑选有它的讲究，等你试完了衣裳，我们再慢慢研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在先去和蓝毒小姐她们会合吧，让她们久等可不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了星极姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在心情好些了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"做自己喜欢的事，很开心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星极","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们出发吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，星极姐姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛和阿卡胡拉的区别是有一点大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有很多不能做的事，房间也比较小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不是很在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我能在这里学到很多新知识，认识到新朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"没有比这更令人开心的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我可以在这里成为一个时尚达人、探险家、术师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"或者有探险精神的时尚术师？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"未来又会发生什么有趣的事呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的很期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔也是因为这些原因，才选择留在罗德岛，而不是待在阿卡胡拉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道嘉维尔现在又在做些什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"忍住啊，也就疼一下的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"疼死了你轻点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"只是疼，死不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"包扎好了，你摁住伤口，我去和客人打个招呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，怎么有人溜到我这里来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉嘉维尔，就偷溜了那一个，其他人全搞定了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，原地休整，注意警戒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"全体外勤干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，终于结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你没事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"你这次出任务那么急，有和你家乡的朋友打过招呼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么好打招呼的，都是熟人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"别人我不太清楚，但那个经常来医疗部看你的同族，你总要和她说声吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"万一没找到你，她不哭到把罗德岛给淹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我们阿卡胡拉出来的人都是一顶一的强者，特米米可没那么脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，之前帮星极做了些活，万一有事，她肯定会出手帮一把的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊你早都算好了啊，当我没说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"别唠叨了，赶紧帮我看看任务结束以后，我们在哪个位置和罗德岛本舰会合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"好，等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"本舰会在这座城市停靠，进行休整和补给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"听说这还是座度假城市，城里有大片的滨水沙滩对游客开放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我们正好能放个假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"那不错嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"（度假城市......滨水沙滩？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"（要不，给她买套水边穿的衣服？她应该会喜欢的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"（就当是，道个歉吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉维尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]}]}
